{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model using weighted fusion, replacing the concatenation method from config_016. Validation accuracy of 0.5232 (vs 0.5266 in config_016) and F1 of 0.5084 (vs 0.5104) suggest a slight performance decrease compared to the concatenation approach. The optimal fusion strategy remains uncertain, as the results do not definitively indicate whether weighted fusion improves upon existing multimodal baselines."
}

